#Notes :

# OLD and NEW keyword
# OLD.column_Name -> Reference a column value from the row before it is updated or deleted. It is read only
# NEW.column_Name -> Reference a Incoming value for a row after an update or insert.
# These are available for FOR EACH ROW triggers.







